    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 595 of the laws of 2007 amending the parks, recreation and historic preservation law relating to establishing the Michigan Street African American Heritage Corridor commission in Buffalo, in relation to extending the effective ness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S5874",
